WEBVTT

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:43.680
Damn these humans, the only thing
they're good at is littering.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.750
What the squid is this?

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:55.770
<b>How much is that squiddy
in the window?</b>

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:01.900
Nagisa!

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.060
What is this?

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:10.510
I think it's a wallet...

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:12.730
Wallet?

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:15.620
Squid Girl?

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:21.030
The owner of the wallet showed up
and left this as a reward.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.550
TEN THOUSAND SQUIDLY YEN?!

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:28.210
What can I buy with
ten thousand yen?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.430
You can buy a bunch of things with that.
DVDs, CDs, games, etc.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.300
Because of the deflation,
the discounts are quite good, too.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.570
If you don't mind buying used,
you'll have even more choices.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:42.520
It's quite usual for things to drop
to 10% of the retail price, too.

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.600
I wonder how much blu-rays
go for used...

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.540
Oh, she froze...

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:51.730
Well, a squid's sense of money probably
can't go beyond a few hundred yen.

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.340
You don't have to spend
it right away.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.700
Just use it when you see
something you want.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:00.460
This squid wants political power!

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:03.050
Life would be easy, if that
could be had for 10,000 yen.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:09.230
But you don't even know what you
can buy here on the surface, right?

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:11.620
Why don't you go to the shopping
district and look around?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:12.370
Take Nagisa.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:16.250
Huh? Why me?

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:20.220
Well, business is slow.
Can't you tag along?

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:25.190
Maybe they'll be a little
friendlier after this.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:27.220
Oh, that's why?

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.040
What do you mean?

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:31.790
I thought you sent her along
because it's funny.

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.650
Sis...

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.210
There's a lot of squidknacks here.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.990
Y-Yeah...

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:43.360
What's that?

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.330
Is she plotting to steal
our technology?

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:49.720
No.

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:50.730
Huh?

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.680
I think electronics will
be too expensive.

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:54.940
I see.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:57.290
What's that over there?

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:03.800
Is she trying to collect information on how
to best conquer the surface world now?!

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:08.410
Uh, I think the store over there
is more fun than books!

00:04:09.320 --> 00:04:10.500
What store?

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.510
Oh, sorry, my mistake...

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.750
Squiddie.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:28.160
Who is she?!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:32.000
Unbelievable! She has me and yet...!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:39.800
Wait.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.070
This is what I'll buy!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:50.340
And this! And that one!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.100
Oh yeah, now I remember...

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:56.310
Do you like shrimp then?

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:59.000
N-Not more than what's
normal for squids.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.910
I just like them in a little super
mega ultra normal way.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.450
That didn't make any sense.

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:09.450
Shrimp, shrimp.

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.870
Squidliedee, squidliedoo.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.550
Shrimp, shrimp.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:13.750
Squidliedee!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.160
Shrimp, shrimp! Squidliedee, squidliedoo!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:27.380
Was it really all right to cook
10,000 yen worth of shrimp?

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.670
Isn't it squidnificent?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.970
The entire place smells like shrimp.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.310
Hey, wait!

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.260
What the squid do you want?

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.750
You don't have enough willpower.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:44.260
You just stole the shrimp off
of Goro's dish last time!

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:47.950
Like Goro has any right to be
eating shrimp in the first place.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:51.870
I don't want you to take other
customers' shrimp, either...

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.700
So learn to control yourself.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:58.170
But they look so tasty...

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:02.550
Even Alex, Sanae's family dog,
can easily wait an hour.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:04.630
Don't compare me to a dog!

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.890
Tasty things should be eaten
without holding back!

00:06:07.890 --> 00:06:08.880
Hey!

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:12.860
What the...?

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:29.110
I can't move my hand, even though
she's merely looking at me.

00:06:33.610 --> 00:06:34.470
Go!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.350
When I say that word, you may eat.

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:41.580
Go...ne is former prime minister,
Yoshida Shigeru.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:44.830
Go...ing to school and studying is important.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:48.080
Go...tta watch out for earthquakes.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.970
This is so nice.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:54.810
Her mastery is scary.

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:01.020
I can't believe she ate all that.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.640
I'm relieved though.
This is more like herself.

00:07:05.530 --> 00:07:07.230
You mean the unbelievable gorging?

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.120
No, I mean the way she
used the money.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:12.950
I guess she went all out.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:14.350
Nope.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:18.350
I mean she could have
had it easy if she had

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.610
applied it to the repair
bill for the wall.

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:27.280
I wasted my chance...

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:31.550
Sis, you're really enjoying
this, aren't you?

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:34.180
Hello! Delivery!

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.260
Coming.

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:36.750
Here you go.

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.890
For Squid Girl?

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:41.730
That's huge!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:44.690
It's from Sanae.
What did she send?

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.400
There's a letter.

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:54.240
<i>I am sending you shrimp to make you happy.
There's plenty, so enjoy yourself.</i>

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:57.200
No way, right? She just pigged out.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.290
You're gonna eat it?!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:01.160
Squids can eat limitless
amounts of shrimp.

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:05.720
It's huge, though!
How much did she send?

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:10.300
P.S. Squiddie, please enjoy
this by yourself.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.630
Enjoy? By yourself?

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.330
Shrimp, shrimp.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.100
Squidliedee, squidliedoo.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.950
You want to eat it?

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:43.960
This place is packed with weirdos.

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.840
Finally done.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:51.490
There were a lot of
customers today.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.110
Good work.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.920
Let's head home.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:55.550
Yeah.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:00.520
<b>Ride 'em, Squiddy!</b>

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.270
You don't need to come.

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.160
Every day it's the same thing.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:12.890
Why not? Where are you going?!

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.630
I told you, we're going home.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:18.240
I'm gonna follow you home today!

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.700
Over my dead body!

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:23.970
I will not allow you to step
one foot in our house!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.750
Ha! You underestimate this squid's resolve.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:35.960
This house is now my squid-vasion
base until the morning!

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:39.430
And now, time for some TV.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:43.850
The yokozuna Kai-no-Umi is standing
to the east, and to the west, ozeki...

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:45.140
Huh?

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:54.510
What's wrong? Are you
not feeling well?

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:57.610
No way...

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:05.100
What the squid am I supposed to
do until morning without you?!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.500
What? The squid-vasion?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:11.490
No, no, it's already past sundown.

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:15.010
The working hours for
a squid-vasion end at five.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:19.720
I'm hungry.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:24.710
They realized that I've
been snacking.

00:10:25.050 --> 00:10:28.700
However, I am not one
to give up so soon!

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:31.280
Squiddie, you understand, right?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:35.610
If I cut this chain,
I'll unleash Chizuru's wrath...

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:41.040
But they're the ones who left
me here without food

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.070
while they went back
to their base alone.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:48.040
If that's how you're going to be,
then it's time to release the Kraken!

00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:55.970
Squid Girl | Chizuru | Eiko
Takeru | Goro | Sanae

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:59.920
Let's begin.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:01.850
Squid-vasion game!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.080
Take this! Squid Punch!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.700
Oh no, I'm done for!
Squid Girl is too strong!

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:11.560
Hahaha! Now do you understand my might?

00:11:20.210 --> 00:11:21.800
No way.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.230
Really? Really? Oh my god, ow!

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:34.790
Squid Ink Attack!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:41.370
I have completely conquered Chizuru!
Eiko will be next!

00:11:46.810 --> 00:11:48.800
Good morning, Squid Girl.

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.190
Morning!

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:52.060
Thanks for watching
the store overnight.

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:57.280
This is for you, they taste great.
We got these from a neighbor.

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:00.300
We made sure to leave you some.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:12.370
Squid Girl! How dare you!
Where did you run to?!

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.530
Show yourself!

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:17.920
I won't be appeased so easily.

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:20.880
Welcome back.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.630
I prepared the bath.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.520
You'll make a good wife.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:27.600
I want to take a shower, too.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.760
Why are you here?!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.440
And why does a squid want
to take a shower?

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:34.710
That's just wrong on
so many levels!

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:38.850
The TV over there is broken,
so she'll stay here.

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.280
What kind of reason is that?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:45.210
I really can't call a house at the sea
without a TV my base, you know?

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.410
That place isn't your base anyway!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.830
You never know what
this one might do.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.730
Soy sauce won't be the end of it!

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.120
Don't worry.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:58.950
Even if something happens,
I will "take care" of it.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:01.500
She's so reliable that it makes
me worry on another front.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.340
Oh well, it's just one night.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:08.420
Compared to Sanae's house,
yours is really shabby, huh?

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:09.970
No, get out right now!

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:12.420
Thanks for the food!

00:13:16.470 --> 00:13:20.460
It's unfair that you get to eat
something this squidlicious every day!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:22.010
I'm glad you like it.

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.150
What have you been
eating until now?

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.100
Oh, it's already this late.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:40.240
I'm going to bed.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:41.070
Huh?

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.030
Yeah, me too.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:45.190
Good night, Squid Girl.

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.990
Good night, Squid Girlie.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.590
You should go to bed, too.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.850
I'm not done playing yet.
Being alone is boring.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:57.300
Takeru

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.400
Takeru, time to squiddle out of bed.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:06.580
Sorry, Squid Girlie.
Tomorrow, okay?

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.530
I thought Takeru would
be ready to play more,

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:16.250
but I guess he's just a kid.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:23.370
Chizuru

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:23.380
So this is Chizuru's room...

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:31.770
My instincts are telling me not
to lay a tentacle on this door.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:35.970
I guess I have no choice
but to wake Eiko.

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:44.240
Hey, Eiko, wake up.

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:48.870
Hey.

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:56.290
Fine!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.540
I am going to sleep here, too!

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.290
What the hell?

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:14.680
Why is Squid Girl sleeping
in my bed?!

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.340
What a big shrimp.

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:19.580
She's talking in her sleep?!

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:21.760
That looks tasty.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:24.270
Gotcha in my tentacles!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.780
Hey, let go!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.070
Good morning.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:26.980
Let go!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:27.580
Breakfast time.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:28.680
Oh, my.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.110
I'm glad, it looks like you're
getting along just fine.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.010
Hey, stop watching and help me.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:34.650
Thanks for the food!

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.260
<b>You're phonier than an
11-tentacled squid!</b>

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:53.550
Man, this side of the beach
has so many people.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:56.050
If we hadn't come to investigate,
we would have never found out.

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.190
Well, let's check out their
special menu items.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.770
Wow!

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.570
It's Squid Girl!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:04.940
Oh wow!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:07.040
They're tentacles!

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:08.390
This is fun!

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:09.640
Hey, squid off.

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:14.880
Hm, Squid Girl's never been over here,
but she's still well known...

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.920
What the hell is that?!

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.900
Is that supposed to be Squid Girl?

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:30.120
Why is it just the head? You could have
tried harder with the clothes!

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:32.510
And why is the head so huge?!

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:35.470
I bet even she will take offense.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.060
There's another me...

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.430
Oh man.

00:16:40.570 --> 00:16:46.070
Get closer and take a look.
It's obviously different, see?

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.400
Hello.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:51.150
I bet the tentacles won't move
because it's fake.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.990
They're moving.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.070
This is quite elaborate.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.060
Try pushing my nose.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.930
Like this?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.790
Whoa, something came out!

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:07.100
Well, the head got big because
I stuffed a lot of things into it.

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:08.500
Who are you?

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:12.210
I am the owner of the
"South Wind House at the Sea."

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:17.300
I saw that your Squid Girl is popular
with the kids, so I made one.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:22.720
The original is quite nice.

00:17:23.700 --> 00:17:26.820
How about it? The fact that we
met like this means something.

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:30.900
Do you want to exchange your
Squid Girl with mine?

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:31.690
Hell no!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:34.270
I'm not saying for free.

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.090
Let's decide this with a match.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:38.550
These two have to try to
take each other's hats.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.160
What if we win?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:42.620
I'll give you 10,000 yen.

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:44.910
I'm in!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:47.520
Begin!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:50.990
Go, Squid Girl, show her the
power of real tentacles!

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:58.520
Removing her hat means death!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:01.610
I can't do it!

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.950
This is our chance!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.530
This is really freaky!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:13.820
Wait, I can't see anything.

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:21.190
My head came off!
My head came off!

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:24.040
Calm down! That's not your head!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.580
That's sure to leave
some mental scars.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:30.770
We'll have to have another match,
since no one won this round.

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:32.250
You still want to continue?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.120
The second round will
be on your turf.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.340
Huh? Are you serious?

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:39.250
Where is your Squid Girl?

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.910
She'll be here soon.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.880
Are you screwing with me?!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.570
This is the "Real Version."

00:18:49.570 --> 00:18:52.060
What's the point of
making it "real"?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:57.550
Don't do anything that'll ruin
Squid Girl's reputation even more.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:01.530
What's "even more" supposed to mean?!

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:06.460
Don't worry, that was a prototype.
This is the enhanced version.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:10.500
Enhanced version? Then why
is it such a sorry affair?

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:14.040
And why can't you just
use a wig and a hat?

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:18.460
That would be nothing
but cosplay!

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:21.950
What are you actually
trying to achieve?

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:26.370
Just listen, that previous Squid Girl was
the type that's popular with kids.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.430
This is the type that
can actually work.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.480
I really don't give a damn.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:33.720
So this is my proposal:
No more hat taking.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:37.100
Instead, how about letting my
Squid Girl work for you.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:41.450
If you decide that she's useful,
I'll borrow yours.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:44.490
Hm, what do you think, Sis?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:47.200
Wait, what about asking
my squidding opinion?!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:50.610
That's fine with me, it sounds fun.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.830
All right, I guess our
Squid Girl can go play then.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:56.290
Should I be happy about that?

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:01.390
Nagisa, instead of Squid Girl,
she'll be working with you today.

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.270
Nice to squidly meet you.

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:07.600
Uh, nice to meet you, too...

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.140
Here you squidly go.

00:20:17.370 --> 00:20:23.110
This is hard to say, but I think
she's hurting business a little.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:24.910
Yes, although she
is a good worker.

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:30.330
Squid Girl's much more efficient since
she can use her tentacles at will.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:37.460
This is not where my Squid Girl
truly shines. It's in the kitchen!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:44.300
She's fast.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:48.250
Done.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.270
Why do you insist on making the
seasonings come out of its face?!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:54.930
And what the hell are you doing?

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:58.350
Since our place's selling point is
the big variety on the menu,

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:01.400
I made sure that she can deal
with any kind of cuisine.

00:21:01.880 --> 00:21:04.310
For instance, if you want
something barbecued...

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:10.060
I'm scared squidless of myself.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:11.870
For the last time, that's not you.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:15.620
Huh? The fire won't stop...

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:20.040
Quick, water!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.140
I can't go on anymore...

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:33.270
Cute...

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:40.790
I apologize for this mess.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:44.240
Are you trying to burn
down our place?!

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:46.490
Sorry about that.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.930
Well anybody can make mistakes.

00:21:48.930 --> 00:21:50.450
I was talking to you!

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:58.170
I'll be back.

00:21:58.410 --> 00:21:59.880
Please don't be!

00:22:00.240 --> 00:22:02.330
Who was that hot chick?

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:03.920
Does she work here?

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:08.220
Maybe we should have hired
the person inside.

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:45.060
H-Hello. Nice to meet you.
I'm Saito Nagisa.

00:23:45.060 --> 00:23:48.030
Next time: Not from this sea are you?

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:50.070
Why not join the school of fish?

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.860
Wouldn't having a pet be squidtastic?

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:55.360
Thank you. It's a pleasure to meet you.
